    "diagnosis": "<em>ELP1</em>-related medulloblastoma predisposition syndrome",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Proposed three-step model of tumorigenesis in <em>ELP1</em>-related medulloblastoma. Step 1: germline variant results in monoallelic inactivation of the <em>ELP1</em> gene (shown in red). Step 2: somatic loss of chromosome 9q results in biallelic inactivation of <em>ELP1</em> and concurrent monoallelic inactivation of the <em>PTCH1</em> gene. Step 3: somatic <em>PTCH1</em> mutation or focal deletion at 9q22.32 results in biallelic inactivation of the <em>PTCH1</em> gene.",
    "source": "Sebastian M. Waszak",
